// Ch8 B03, side scene (optional) "The Keeping Flame" (act1_ch08.md §4; F01, one locked shot plus
// inserts of the driftwood and Fenn's hands). The keeper's hut at Coilspire's foot, by the hearth that
// feeds the spire. No music: wind and fire. Old Fenn has kept the low flame for forty-one years and has
// never let it go out. He doesn't get up. He lets Asha feed it, "like you'd put a blanket on a sleeping
// child". Then he looks at her properly.
// Rules: no more than four Fenn lines in a row (SPEC §3.6), broken by Asha's feeding and questions.
// Fenn says nothing about the 1001 stair, the watch or its captain (rule 3). He met Imra at the hearth,
// not at the gate. Asha smiles first, and it costs her (smile, then a held neutral).
// Sets ch08_fed_the_beacon: in B07 Fenn climbs the spire and hands Asha the great key; in Ch9 he
// kneels at the Ebbing.
title: ch08_keeping_flame
location: ch08/coilspire
---
@camera F01
@music silence fade=1.5
@sfx hearth_crackle
@anim fenn feed_fire
@wait 1.5
Fenn [neutral]: Shut the door, Lady. She doesn't like a draught she didn't ask for. #line:ch08_flame_001
@mark asha hearth_asha walk via=way_forecourt_e,way_hut_door_out,way_hut_door_in
@wait 0.8
Asha [soft_smile]: May I? #line:ch08_flame_002
@camera F01_hands
@anim fenn hand_driftwood asha
Fenn [neutral]: Like you'd put a blanket on a sleeping child. Not a log on a fire. #line:ch08_flame_003
@anim asha feed_fire
@sfx hearth_settle
@wait 1.5
@camera F01
Fenn [neutral]: There. She'll take that from you. #line:ch08_flame_004
@anim fenn look_at asha
@wait 1.0
Fenn [neutral]: The last one fed her too. Eleven years back. Year of the last Rising. #line:ch08_flame_005
Asha [neutral]: My mother. #line:ch08_flame_006
Fenn [soft_smile]: Said she had a girl at home. Said the girl'd be braver than her. #line:ch08_flame_007
@wait 0.8
Asha [surprised]: ...She said that? #line:ch08_flame_008
Fenn [neutral]: Said it to a fire. Fires don't carry tales. I do. #line:ch08_flame_009
@face asha smile 0.6
@wait 1.2
@face asha neutral 1.0
@wait 1.5
Asha [neutral]: How long have you kept her? #line:ch08_flame_010
Fenn [neutral]: Forty-one years. Never once let her out. Opened the beacon full twice. #line:ch08_flame_011
@anim fenn feed_fire
Fenn [soft_smile]: Third time's coming. I can smell it. #line:ch08_flame_012
Asha [soft_smile]: Then I hope you're kept waiting a long while. #line:ch08_flame_013
<<set $ch08_fed_the_beacon = true>>
@wait 1.0
===
